{"id":"01_2512","type":"item","name":{"ja":"Figure-rise Standard 魔人ブウ（純粋）","en":"Figure-rise Standard Majin Buu (Pure)"},"description":[{"ja":"Figure-rise Standard 魔人ブウ（純粋）がパッケージをリニューアルして登場！！","en":"Figure-rise Standard Majin Buu (pure) is now available with a renewed package! !"},{"ja":"• 自制心がまったくない、悪そのものの存在、魔人ブウ（純粋）が待望のFigure-rise Standardに登場！","en":"• Majin Buu (pure), an existence of evil itself with no self-control, appears in the long-awaited Figure-rise Standard!"},{"ja":"• 小さい体に凝縮された圧倒的なパワーを感じさせるマッシブな肉体造形。","en":"• Massive body design that makes you feel overwhelming power concentrated in a small body."},{"ja":"• 魔人ブウ（純粋）の多彩な表情変化を再現したフェイスパーツは、通常・悪の2種類が付属！目元や口元の細かな変化、凶悪な表情を巧みに造形し、ハイクオリティな完成度！","en":"• Two types of face parts are included: normal and evil, which reproduce the various expression changes of Majin Buu (pure)! Fine changes in the eyes and mouth, as well as the ferocious expression, are skillfully sculpted to create a high-quality figure!"},{"ja":"• パーツ組立による表情形成技術で漆黒の中に光る赤い瞳を、プリントズレすることなく再現！","en":"• Using facial expression technology to assemble parts, red eyes glowing in jet black are reproduced without any print misalignment!"},{"ja":"• 気功波やバニシングボールの巨大な気弾エフェクトも付属。同時発売のFigure-rise Standard超サイヤ人3孫悟空と組み合わせてドラゴンボールZの感動のラストバトルを再現可能！","en":"• Giant Qi bullet effects such as Qigong wave and Vanishing ball are also included. You can recreate the thrilling final battle of Dragon Ball Z by combining it with the simultaneously released Figure-rise Standard Super Saiyan 3 Son Goku!"},{"ja":"• Figure-rise Standard「ドラゴンボール」シリーズを集めて、圧倒的バトルシーンを再現しよう！","en":"• Collect Figure-rise Standard \"Dragon Ball\" series and recreate overwhelming battle scenes!"}],"accessories":[{"ja":"顔（別表情：悪）×1","en":"Face (different expression: evil) x 1"},{"ja":"手首[バニシングボール]　(左右)×各1","en":"Wrist [vanishing ball] (left and right) x 1 each"},{"ja":"バニシングボールエフェクト×1","en":"Vanishing ball effect x1"},{"ja":"気功波エフェクト×1","en":"Qigong wave effect x1"}],"contents":[{"ja":"成形品×4","en":"Molded p